            <div xml:id="d542">

                <pb facs="0485" n="403" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg403"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/740.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Mexican Ambassador.</hi></head>
                <p>On the 6th instant the Mexican Embassy addressed to the Department of State a
                    memorandum stating that persistent rumors have reached Mexico that in some towns
                    of Texas [etc.].</p>
                <p>The Department of State has taken pleasure in sending copies of the memorandum
                    from the Mexican Embassy to the Secretary of War and the Attorney General for
                    their information.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of
                            State</hi>,<lb/><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-02-07"><hi rendition="#italic">February 7,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
